00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:09,320
In the fell clutch of circumstance, I

278
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:11,520
have not winced nor cried aloud.

279
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:14,480
Under the bludgeonings of fate, my head

280
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:17,080
is bloodied, but unbowed.

281
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:19,320
Beyond this place of wrath and tears,

282
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:21,240
looms but the horror of the shade.

283
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:25,200
And yet the menace of the years shall

284
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:27,360
find me, and find me unafraid.

285
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:30,080
It matters not how straight the gate,

286
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:32,200
how charged with punishments the scroll.

287
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:35,520
You are the master of your own fate, you

288
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:37,240
are the captain of your own souls.

289
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:39,360
You are some of the very best the world

290
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:42,040
has to offer, and you are now officially

291
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:44,240
part of a very special community.

292
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:46,760
Never give up, and always remember it's

293
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:48,920
about how you make people feel.

294
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:50,640
May God bless you all,

295
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:53,560
and may fortune continue to smile on you

296
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:53,560
all of your days.

297
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:58,760
As Damon Albarn of Blur famously once

298
00:10:56,520 --> 00:11:00,880
sang in the beautiful ballad Tender,

299
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:02,720
love is the greatest thing we have.

300
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:04,600
Hold it dear and close to your heart,

301
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:06,760
and I really wish you the most fulfilled

302
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:09,240
and wonderful life. Congratulations,

303
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:13,120
class of 2024. We all so proud of you

304
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:13,120
and love you dearly. Congratulations.

